{
  "_note": {
    "good": "card/every-lamport-can-move build at f9ab10a30 (mainnet; reviews P1-1, P1-2 and P2-1 of 1d3b96d9c in): packages/signpage index.html and app.js as build-app.mjs --out wrote them on that branch: PASS (a full sell with no deposit back, its one sweep a grid note and the rest under the grid paid to the pin's fee payer by one System transfer, only tokens on W's own coins' accounts keep W whole, a partial sell's deposit back on the grid; marks 0 to 9 are that card's rules, false in every older answer)",
    "bad": "11c963f9's build (mainnet), the committed packages/signpage/index.html and public/app.js there: W's surplus left on W, no sweep past a kept account: FAIL; its facts read again from that commit's committed bundle under the marks as card round-trip-costs-less has them; the found W's rule (card buy-spends-several-pieces) is in none of them",
    "beforeFold": "08290868's build (mainnet), the committed packages/signpage/index.html and public/app.js there, before delta review 7's fold (no buy record: an airdrop's full sell swept W with its own coin held): FAIL on the seen and the own-coin rules alone; its facts read again from that commit's committed bundle under the marks as card round-trip-costs-less has them; the found W's rule (card buy-spends-several-pieces) is in none of them",
    "beforeFold8": "5697d7a1's build (mainnet), the committed packages/signpage/index.html and public/app.js there, before delta review 8's fold (no buy record: the page's holdings, the helper's word on mainnet, decided the pass and were part of what W read as): FAIL on the seen and own-coin rules; its facts read again from that commit's committed bundle under the marks as card round-trip-costs-less has them; the found W's rule (card buy-spends-several-pieces) is in none of them",
    "beforeFloor": "main 383b1ffe's build (mainnet; release-102, kit-sol-pool-deposit-floor merged), the committed packages/signpage/index.html and public/app.js there: the sell's rule refuses only a note under the pool's least deposit, so it signs a deposit back under the kit's release floor: FAIL on the sell's rule alone; its facts read again from that commit's committed bundle under the marks as card round-trip-costs-less has them; the found W's rule (card buy-spends-several-pieces) is in none of them",
    "beforeLamport": "the good answer before card every-lamport-can-move (card/round-trip-costs-less build (mainnet; main c32f749c6 merged)): FAIL on that card's seven rules alone",
    "before1d": "card/every-lamport-can-move build at 1d3b96d9c (mainnet), before its review: the rest under the grid paid to the pool's account, by the builder and the rule, and tokens on any account keep W whole: FAIL on those three marks (5, 6, 9) alone"
  },
